            </g>

            <!-- Arrow -->
            <path d="M 186 32 L 208 32" fill="none" stroke="#0284c7" stroke-width="2.2" marker-end="url(#arr-b)"/>

            <!-- H2O Molecule - Precise Orbit Intersection Alignment and Even Non-Bonding Spacing -->
            <g transform="translate(215, 0)">
                <circle cx="75" cy="32" r="25" fill="#f0f9ff" stroke="#0284c7" stroke-width="1.5"/>
                <circle cx="75" cy="32" r="12" fill="none" stroke="#cbd5e1" stroke-width="1"/>
                <circle cx="75" cy="32" r="6.5" fill="url(#nuc-red)"/>
                <text x="75" y="32.5" font-size="6.5" font-weight="900" fill="#ffffff" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central">+8</text>
                
                <!-- Oxygen inner shell 2 electrons -->
                <circle cx="75.0" cy="20.0" r="3" fill="url(#e-grad)"/>
                <circle cx="75.0" cy="44.0" r="3" fill="url(#e-grad)"/>

                <!-- Oxygen outer non-bonding electrons: Symmetrically spaced along top and bottom of outer shell -->
                <circle cx="68.5" cy="7.8" r="3" fill="url(#e-grad)"/>
                <circle cx="81.5" cy="7.8" r="3" fill="url(#e-grad)"/>
                <circle cx="68.5" cy="56.2" r="3" fill="url(#e-grad)"/>
                <circle cx="81.5" cy="56.2" r="3" fill="url(#e-grad)"/>

                <!-- Left H sharing (cx=42, cy=32, r=18) -->
                <circle cx="42" cy="32" r="18" fill="#eff6ff" opacity="0.75" stroke="#0284c7" stroke-width="1.5"/>
                <circle cx="42" cy="32" r="5.5" fill="url(#nuc-red)"/>
                <text x="42" y="32.5" font-size="6.5" font-weight="900" fill="#ffffff" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central">+1</text>
                <!-- Shared pair 1: Exactly on circle intersection points -->
                <circle cx="53.94" cy="18.53" r="3" fill="url(#e-grad)"/>
                <circle cx="53.94" cy="45.47" r="3" fill="url(#e-grad)"/>

                <!-- Right H sharing (cx=108, cy=32, r=18) -->
                <circle cx="108" cy="32" r="18" fill="#eff6ff" opacity="0.75" stroke="#0284c7" stroke-width="1.5"/>
                <circle cx="108" cy="32" r="5.5" fill="url(#nuc-red)"/>
                <text x="108" y="32.5" font-size="6.5" font-weight="900" fill="#ffffff" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central">+1</text>
                <!-- Shared pair 2: Exactly on circle intersection points -->
                <circle cx="96.06" cy="18.53" r="3" fill="url(#e-grad)"/>
                <circle cx="96.06" cy="45.47" r="3" fill="url(#e-grad)"/>

                <text x="75" y="75" font-size="9.5" font-weight="900" fill="#0f172a" text-anchor="middle">물 분자 (H₂O)</text>
            </g>
        </g>
                        </svg>
                    </div>
                    
                    <div class="sub-box">
                        <div class="sub-box-title">■ 공유 결합 형성 보충:</div>
                        <ul class="bullet-list">
                            <li><b>공유 결합의 원리:</b> 비금속 원자들이 서로 전자를 내놓아 <b>공유 전자쌍</b>을 형성하여 비활성 기체와 같이 안정한 전자 배치를 이룸.</li>
                            <li><b>옥텟 규칙 만족:</b> 수소(H) 원자는 1개, 산소(O) 원자는 2개의 전자를 공유하여 모두 안정한 전자 배치를 형성함.</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </div>

